i
Split "\n"
Split Each "\t"
Convert Each to Integers
Part "1":
    Map Each
        Using: (x) -> max(x) - min(x)
    Sum
    stdout
Part "2":
    Map Each
        All Pairs
            Mode: First
            Using: (a, b) -> (a % b = 0) or (b % a = 0)
    Map Each
        Using: (x) -> max(x) / min(x)
    Sum
    stdout
